","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f0539e2dfb395a33b142","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-o022","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-93d5da2e078d5ca12eb0","layer":"original","quote":"五年春二月〖13〗，诏大将军曹爽率众征蜀。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o061b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-07987637cc4b4315dd87","layer":"original","quote":"爽参军杨伟为爽陈形势：“宜急还〖12〗，不然将败。”﹝二﹞飏与伟争于爽前，伟曰：“飏、胜将败国家事〖13〗，可斩也！”爽不悦，乃引军还。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":260,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":76,"end":144},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p027a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-0a02d0f40d13348b76cc","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《世语》曰：“伟字世英，冯翊人。明帝治宫室，伟谏曰：‘今作宫室，斩伐生民墓上松柏，毁坏碑兽石柱；辜及亡人，伤孝子心，不可以为后世之法则。’”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":277,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0da966bd86103acdaaaa","start":0,"end":73},{"id":"xiahoucao-f0054-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-0a02d0f40d13348b76cc","layer":"pei","quote":"伟字世英","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":277,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0da966bd86103acdaaaa","start":10,"end":14},{"id":"xiahoucao-f0055-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-0a02d0f40d13348b76cc","layer":"pei","quote":"冯翊人","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":277,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0da966bd86103acdaaaa","start":15,"end":18},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o061","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-07987637cc4b4315dd87","layer":"original","quote":"正始五年，爽乃西至长安，大发卒六七万人，从骆谷入。是时，关中及氐、羌转输不能供〖11〗，牛马骡驴多死，民夷号泣道路。入谷行数百里，贼因山为固，兵不得进。爽参军杨伟为爽陈形势：“宜急还〖12〗，不然将败。”﹝二﹞飏与伟争于爽前，伟曰：“飏、胜将败国家事〖13〗，可斩也！”爽不悦，乃引军还。﹝三﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":260,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":147},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p027","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-0a02d0f40d13348b76cc","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《世语》曰：“伟字世英，冯翊人。明帝治宫室，伟谏曰：‘今作宫室，斩伐生民墓上松柏，毁坏碑兽石柱；辜及亡人，伤孝子心，不可以为后世之法则。’”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":277,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0da966bd86103acdaaaa","start":0,"end":73},{"id":"xinyang-q-92333186eb3b5ca98bb9","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-0f8637d3e6b79ec73f25","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏略》曰：“太史上汉历不及天时，因更推步弦、望、朔、晦，为《太和历》。帝以隆学问优深，于天文又精，乃诏使隆与尚书郎杨伟、太史待诏骆禄，参共推校。伟、禄，是太史；隆故据旧历。更相劾奏，纷纭数岁。伟称：禄得日蚀而月晦不尽；隆不得日蚀而月晦尽。诏从太史。隆所争虽不得，而远近犹知其精微也。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":373,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5bd986b17d5a910db409","start":0,"end":146}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
